{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16074","headline":"秋日送杜虔州 · 王建","name":"秋日送杜虔州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆得宿新宅，别来余蕙香。\n初闻守郡远，一日卧空牀。\n野驿烟火湿，路人消息狂。\n山楼添鼓角，村栅立旗枪。\n晚渚露荷败，早衙风桂凉。\n谢家章句出，江月少辉光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}